<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: legion material I - Dark Angels -->
  <BEWH_ChapterMaterialI.label>军团材料 I - 黑暗天使</BEWH_ChapterMaterialI.label>
  <!-- EN: A specialized container designed to store and preserve the sacred genetic data of a specific Astartes Legion. Legion material develops within a Space Marine's body and can be harvested once fully developed and retrieved from the fallen.\n\nThis unit holds the genetic mutation material of Legion I - Dark Angels. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterMaterialI.description>专为储存特定星际战士军团神圣基因数据设计的容器。军团材料在星际战士体内发育成熟后，可从阵亡者体内回收。\n\n此容器包含第一军团“黑暗天使”的基因突变物质。</BEWH_ChapterMaterialI.description>
  <!-- EN: Dark Angels -->
  <BEWH_ChapterMaterialI.modExtensions.0.shownMaterialName>黑暗天使</BEWH_ChapterMaterialI.modExtensions.0.shownMaterialName>
  
